  "prefLabel": "Rev 1404.01 Payment Forms and Payments",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1404.01 Payment Forms and Payments. Form DP-255-ES, “Estimated Utility Property Tax”, shall be filed electronically through the Granite Tax Connect portal located at www.revenue.nh.gov/gtc, or mailed to:\n\nNew Hampshire Department of Revenue Administration\n\nTaxpayer Services Division\n\nP.O. Box 637\n\n109 Pleasant Street\n\nConcord, NH 03302-0637\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev1400) #9841, eff 12-23-10; ss by #12164, eff 4-29-17; ss by #12706, eff 1-8-19; ss by #13490, eff 11-15-22",
